@startuml

title ComponentHub - Cataloguer Maintains a Component

actor Cataloguer
participant "Component page\n(app.js)" as UI
participant "Catalogue client\n(catalogue.js)" as Client
participant "Express API" as API
database "SQLite" as DB

Cataloguer -> UI: Choose Edit, Keywords or Delete

alt Edit metadata
  UI -> Client: updateComponent(id, data)
  Client -> API: PUT /api/components/{id}
  API -> API: Authenticate and check Cataloguer role
  API -> DB: Update metadata and keywords transactionally
  DB --> API: Updated component
  API --> Client: Updated component
  Client -> Client: Merge component into cache
  Client --> UI: Refresh details
else Update keywords only
  UI -> Client: setKeywords(id, keywords)
  Client -> API: PUT /api/components/{id}/keywords
  API -> API: Authenticate and check Cataloguer role
  API -> DB: Replace component keywords
  DB --> API: Updated component
  API --> Client: Updated component
  Client -> Client: Merge component into cache
  Client --> UI: Refresh details
else Delete component
  Cataloguer -> UI: Confirm deletion
  UI -> Client: remove(id)
  Client -> API: DELETE /api/components/{id}
  API -> API: Authenticate and check Cataloguer role
  API -> DB: Delete component
  DB --> API: Deletion complete
  API --> Client: 204 No Content
  Client -> Client: Remove component from cache
  Client --> UI: Navigate to Browse
end

alt Validation, not found or permission failure
  API --> Client: 400/403/404 error
  Client --> UI: Throw error
  UI --> Cataloguer: Show error
end
@enduml
